"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-01T07:24:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-11T18:45:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible on master branch.\n\n### System information\n\nMetal 4.0 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Apple - Apple M5 (Apple9)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen  using h_separation and arrow_margin the OptionButton scales unpredictable. The h_separation is used for the internal Button Icon but also for the arrow_icon. The descriptions says `The horizontal space between Button's icon and text. Negative values will be treated as 0 when used.` So this shouldn't be used for other icons.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2e40202-b81c-448c-a169-28763d86e3fb\n\nSame happens in the `CheckBox`\n\n<img width=\"715\" height=\"195\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/695eccd1-dbe1-41d6-af95-4c7af3deb45b\" />\n\nI was looking at the code for the last 3 days and debugged it to understand the behavior. The implementation is really messy and not easy to understand. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse the h_separation and arrow_margin theme overrides. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n-","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120808/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote